Z||000000||SpeedPhreak||01-31-2000||11:37 PM||||because i was pi$$ed at the dealer who sold me my fiero for mechanical problems (he fixed up just well enough to drive) i didnt pay him for the last few months.  so they came & got it tonight.<P>ive put about $100 in parts in (not to mention labor & frustration) & it has sat for the last 3 months.  actually i was going to go get insurance, reg, & pay him the 900 i owe him tomorrow cause it goes now.  but thats not the way its gonna work.<P>so i can go pay him all his fees & get my fiero including all problems.  or i can go get something else (credit is not a problem).<P>numbers look like this on an 84se...<P>payed...     $1000<BR>parts in...  $c100<BR>owed...      $c900<BR>insurance... $120dwn 85mo<BR>registration ???<P>it also needs new tires, windshield, plus soon a rebuild/replace, brakes, suspension. plus a engine light that comes on i havent tested for yet.<P>so, should i let it go & go shopping (fiero, eclipse, nova) or take it up the wazoo & pay him to get my fiero back?<P>||||reg||9
